// 接口调试请求清单
// 用法：点击每个 ### 请求块上方的 "Send Request"，响应在右侧面板展示
// 默认全部指向 httpbin.org 演练地址，零风险、无需任何 SAP 权限

@mockHost = https://httpbin.org

### 1. 测试公开的健康检查 / 模拟接口
GET {{mockHost}}/get HTTP/1.1
User-Agent: VSCode-SAP-Client

### 2. 模拟 SAP OData 发票查询请求（示例）
# 实际项目中只需替换为你本地 S/4HANA 的真实 OData 地址与凭证
GET {{mockHost}}/json HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer mock_token_for_s4hana
Accept: application/json

### 3. 模拟电子发票 XML 提交 POST 请求
POST {{mockHost}}/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyCode": "IT99",
  "documentType": "TD02",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "currency": "EUR"
}

### 4. 模板：真实 S/4HANA OData 发票抬头查询（默认不执行，替换后再发）
# 提示：主机名建议放在环境变量里，凭证不要写进仓库
# @s4Host = https://<your-s4-host>:44300
# @s4Client = 100
# GET {{s4Host}}/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_BILLING_DOCUMENT_SRV/A_BillingDocument?$top=5&sap-client={{s4Client}}
# Authorization: Basic <base64(user:password)>
# Accept: application/json
